[{"name":"0.1.0: SD-XL 1.0 with permissive license","uuid":"113782077","tag_name":"0.1.0","target_commitish":"main","body":"## Release\r\n- Releasing two new open models with a permissive [CreativeML Open RAIL++-M license](https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models/blob/main/model_licenses/LICENSE-SDXL1.0) (see [Inference](https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models#inference) for file hashes):\r\n    - [SDXL-base-1.0](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0): An improved version over SDXL-base-0.9.\r\n    - [SDXL-refiner-1.0](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-refiner-1.0): An improved version over SDXL-refiner-0.9.\r\n- Sharing the technical report on SDXL is now available [here](https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.01952)\r\n\r\n![001_with_eval](https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models/assets/62965623/e457ed1e-e688-4da9-a625-bf16ed2c5ed2)\r\n\r\n## Contributions\r\n- #17: Setup packaging with hatch\r\n- #59: Freeze requirements for .pt13, .pt2 environments, add black formatter \u0026 automatic build tests\r\n- #57, #66: Add automatic inference tests with pytest, add codeowner\r\n- #69: Improve inference code\r\n- #68, #67, #70, #71: Update README, Licenses, model names \u0026 hashes","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"immutable":null,"published_at":"2023-07-27T08:07:20.000Z","created_at":"2023-07-26T18:14:23.000Z","author":"benjaminaubin","assets":[],"last_synced_at":"2023-11-21T20:27:16.700Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models/releases/tag/0.1.0","release_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/Stability-AI%2Fgenerative-models/releases/0.1.0","tag_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/Stability-AI%2Fgenerative-models/tags/0.1.0"}]